  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower New Energy: Pilot Project- solar minigrid and battery, Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower New Energy has conducted feasibility studies for 15 projects in Cameroon, Permits have been obtained and PPA&apos;s concluded with the government. This grant will be used for support of capex as a pilot (maximum 15 pst according to the grant scheeme). The support gives the company flexibility to accept a certain numbers of no-paying customers without increasing the tariff.</narrative>
  </description>
